  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "An Air Force veteran named Mario Woods says he reported his 1977 alien encounter to AARO, the Pentagon office set up to look into UFO reports, in March 2023, but the office never followed up, and his fellow airman Michael Johnson was never found by them. Woods tells it first-hand on two episodes. In one he adds that the interview ran four hours and nineteen minutes and was not recorded. He tells it to show that the office did not take witnesses like him seriously."
